  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100888,
      "id": "201edc93-37b4-556a-aaea-4fcf9a01077a",
      "title": "Identifying a Solution to a First-Order Differential Equation"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "a5b7fee8-5f6e-53bd-be63-a8e96a341c21",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following differential equation.\n\n$$\ny\\prime=\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)=\\frac{\\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4}.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $f\\prime(x)=\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}.$\n- **II.** Substituting $y=f(x)$ and $y\\prime=f\\prime(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement.\n- **III.** The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in an interval where the function is defined and the equation is valid.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. Differentiating $f(x)=\\frac{\\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f\\prime(x)&=\\left(\\frac{\\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4}\\right)\\prime \\\\ &=\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 4\\cos(4x) \\\\ &=\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. Substituting $y=\\frac{\\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4}$ and $y\\prime=\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}$ into the original equation gives an identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y\\prime &\\overset{?}{=}\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\\\ \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)} &=\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since statement II is true, the function $y=\\frac{\\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4}$ is a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\"",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "d38188bf-e519-5781-b6f8-fd6804ce0078",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
